jsdiff/libesm/diff/base.js|REPLACED|S2|diff.rs|Myers is `similar`; ChangeObject shape kept. Divergence: hunk and run boundaries may differ where several minimal diffs exist; maxEditLength/timeout/callback/comparator options not offered
jsdiff/libesm/diff/line.js|REPLACED|S2|diff.rs|diffLines -> diff::diff_lines (invariants and minimal edit totals checked against jsdiff goldens); ignoreWhitespace/newlineIsToken/stripTrailingCr/ignoreNewlineAtEof options not offered
jsdiff/libesm/diff/word.js|REPLACED|S2|diff.rs|diffWordsWithSpace -> diff::diff_words_with_space. Divergence: tokens are similar's (whitespace runs and non-whitespace runs), not jsdiff's word/punctuation tokens, so word-diff ranges differ; invariants only
jsdiff/libesm/diff/character.js|REPLACED|S2|diff.rs|diffChars -> diff::diff_chars
