jsdiff/libesm/util/params.js|OUT|-||option plumbing
jsdiff/libesm/util/distance-iterator.js|OUT|-||only jsdiff applyPatch uses it
jsdiff/libesm/patch/create.js|REPLACED|S2|diff.rs|createTwoFilesPatch -> diff::create_two_files_patch (Index/underline/---/+++ headers, always-present hunk counts, no-newline marker, C-quoted names; hunk boundaries from similar)
